72 #uuid "6343760b-b53e-5293-9f9e-2e583031956b" 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410158 1074 "The full expression describing all points on our elliptic cylinder is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{36}=1,\\,z=k\n$$\n\nwhere $k\\in R$ can vary arbitrarily. \n\nThe domain of any cylinder in the $xy$-plane is its base curve. Hence, in this case, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}:\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{36}=1}\n$$\n\nwhich can be written as\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}:\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{{2}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{{6}^{2}}=1}.\n$$\n\nThis is an ellipse centered at $(4,2)$ with semi-axes of lengths $2$ and $6.$" 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410159 1062 #uuid "1c159990-55c8-5aa1-b89e-ba1b9d7acf3b" 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410159 1063 #edb/ref 17592186284489 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410160 1058 #edb/ref 17592186410159 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410160 1062 #uuid "33921a36-2e91-50fa-a06c-a30b1124550d" 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410160 1063 #edb/ref 17592186410158 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410161 1058 #edb/ref 17592186410160 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410161 1062 #uuid "5707a2b8-ff1e-50c1-9adc-a0aa60ce9a37" 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410161 1063 #edb/ref 17592186284485 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410162 1058 #edb/ref 17592186410161 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410162 1062 #uuid "62e270dc-12aa-54da-a6ae-4add22cc9797" 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410162 1063 #edb/ref 17592186401467 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410163 1058 #edb/ref 17592186410162 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410163 1062 #uuid "84b4522c-b64f-561e-af00-35a410d9aa0f" 13194139533591 17592186045417 true] [17592186410163 1063 #edb/ref 17592186124879 13194139533591 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-8c885820-a4e6-551c-b58e-779ad796568b" 175921